                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr>
                      <td><strong>Budget</strong></td>
                      <td>$2,500 – $5,500</td>
                      <td>Baseboard replacement (whole home 1,500 sq ft), door casing updates, basic MDF crown molding in 2–3 rooms</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td><strong>Mid-Range</strong></td>
                      <td>$6,000 – $11,000</td>
                      <td>Crown molding + chair rail in 4–6 rooms, wainscoting in dining room or hallway, upgraded door casings and window aprons throughout</td>
                    </tr>
